{"unit_id":"lrplrplrp__dsh-live2d#card-zh","repo":"lrplrplrp/dsh-live2d","commit":"1ba6522a18408716a5c71a81575503ddad9b96be","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Live2D 看板娘是面向 DSH Web 的 Live2D 桌面伴侣插件。它把可拖动的模型注入 Web 界面覆盖层，并在设置页提供模型和动画配置。插件监听 DSH 会话状态，通过实时推送和轮询切换思考、工作、输出、完成及错误动画；还支持鼠标视线跟随、拖动与缩放、画布尺寸调整和按时间段播放动画。用户可导入本地模型并编辑状态映射，配置保存在浏览器本地。适合希望在 DSH 工作时获得可视化状态反馈并自定义虚拟形象的 Web 用户；需要在 DSH Web 环境安装，不需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/src/90-apply.js:16-41","lib/index.js:208-260","lib/src/40-engine.js:306-345","lib/src/80-settings.js:176-212"]}
{"unit_id":"lrplrplrp__dsh-live2d#card-en","repo":"lrplrplrp/dsh-live2d","commit":"1ba6522a18408716a5c71a81575503ddad9b96be","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Live2D 看板娘 adds a draggable avatar to DSH Web. It maps session states to animations and includes settings for models, mouse gaze, and time based mappings. Users can import local models and resize the canvas. Settings stay in browser storage; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/src/90-apply.js:16-41","lib/index.js:208-260","lib/src/40-engine.js:306-345","lib/src/80-settings.js:176-212"]}
